{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40702","headline":"赠永崇李将军充襄阳制置使 · 李洞","name":"赠永崇李将军充襄阳制置使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拜官门外发辉光，宿卫阴符注几行。\n行处近天龙尾滑，猎时陪帝马鬃香。\n九城王气生旗队，万里寒风入箭疮。\n从此浩然声价歇，武中还有李襄阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}